Package: com.ma6x9x.kernellab
Name: Kernellab
Version: 0.3.0
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64
Description: userspace micro-lab for iOS/XNU kernel research. Pick a saved
 kernelcache (target.json), survivor-diff pinned method tables across two
 builds, and dry-run the allowlisted userspace stub (sim ident).
 26.5 is 23F77 and 27.0 is 24A435 (24A437 is the unpinned 27.0-family
 cache). The Apple-submit gate stays closed. JB-rig kernel testing is
 not a fileable finding. No kernelcaches included (operator-supplied).
 SpringBoard app KernelLab.app opens the localhost console. Operator
 probe trees belong in /var/jb/var/kernellab/probes and are not packaged.
Maintainer: kolby <noreply@github.com>
Author: kolbymaxx
Section: Research
Depends: python3
Homepage: https://github.com/ma6x9x/KernelLab
